# [[= vault =]]

> [[= owner =]]'s knowledge base: plain Markdown files in an Obsidian vault, sorted into PARA folders (Projects, Areas, Resources, Archive) plus Tasks and People, and run with GTD. Rules live in Agents/; `python3 .scripts/vault-lint` validates every change. Paths below are relative to the vault root.

Key points:
- Start at AGENTS.md. Where AGENTS.md and Agents/ disagree, the manual wins; [[= owner =]]'s direct instruction beats both.
- One file per item (Task, Project, Area, Resource, or Person), filename = kebab-case slug of the title, frontmatter per Agents/schema.md.
- Act, then report; stop and ask before anything that leaves the vault. Full permission tiers in Agents/agent-protocol.md.
- Kit-managed pages are updated by `copier update`; this vault's own rules live in Agents/local/.

## Start here

- [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md): Entrypoint. Folder map, the short loop, permissions, common commands
- [Agents index](Agents/README.md): Reading order, roles, common requests mapped to recipes, precedence, kit-managed pages
- [Strict rules](Agents/strict-rules.md): The non-negotiables with stable IDs, most checked by vault-lint
- [Local rules](Agents/local/local-rules.md): This vault's own rules (L1, L2, …), never touched by the kit
- [Agent protocol](Agents/agent-protocol.md): Operating loop, permission tiers, report template, run logs, running alongside other agents, safe editing alongside Obsidian Sync and git

## Roles

Who owns what and the phrases that start each: [Agents index](Agents/README.md) (Roles).

- [Vault intake](Agents/roles/role-vault-intake.md): File the drop folders: imported files become Resources with their attachments, capture notes become tasks, facts, and people
- [Vault pm](Agents/roles/role-vault-pm.md): Sort the inbox, run one named project, daily and weekly review
- [Vault docs](Agents/roles/role-vault-docs.md): Merge, rename, archive Resources and People; Check mode lists contradictions and stale claims by severity; Erase mode erases an item [[= owner =]] names, everywhere
- [Vault ask](Agents/roles/role-vault-ask.md): Answer from the vault, research a decision, grill a plan
- [Vault ops](Agents/roles/role-vault-ops.md): Keep the machinery running: archive and promote sweeps, store and manifest checks, plugin updates, backup and git health
- [Vault admin](Agents/roles/role-vault-admin.md): The manual, vault-lint, settings, and kit updates

